@Fraga.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5007
@AccountId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### Listar contas
GET {{Fraga.Api_HostAddress}}/api/accounts
Accept: application/json

### Crédito
POST {{Fraga.Api_HostAddress}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6",
  "accountId": "{{AccountId}}",
  "type": "CREDIT",
  "amount": 150.75,
  "occurredAt": "2026-01-30T10:15:00Z"
}

### Débito
POST {{Fraga.Api_HostAddress}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "9b2c1d3e-1111-4a5b-8c7d-0123456789ab",
  "accountId": "{{AccountId}}",
  "type": "DEBIT",
  "amount": 50.00,
  "occurredAt": "2026-01-30T10:20:00Z"
}

### Extrato (página 1)
GET {{Fraga.Api_HostAddress}}/api/accounts/{{AccountId}}/transactions?page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json